.. image:: img/ws2812b.gif
   :align: right
   :alt: No Name Technology Mini USB RP2350 WS2812 LED Test Pattern

.. rubric:: WS2812 LED Test Pattern by PIO

See also Zephyr sample: :external+zephyr:zephyr:code-sample:`led-strip`.

   .. rubric:: On Hazard3 RISC-V (RV32IMAC+)

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/drivers/led/led_strip
      :build-dir: mini_usb_rp2350
      :board: mini_usb_rp2350/rp2350a/hazard3_0
      :gen-args: -DCONFIG_SAMPLE_LED_UPDATE_DELAY=500
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

   .. rubric:: On ARM Cortex-M33

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/drivers/led/led_strip
      :build-dir: mini_usb_rp2350
      :board: mini_usb_rp2350/rp2350a/m33_0
      :gen-args: -DCONFIG_SAMPLE_LED_UPDATE_DELAY=500
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

.. hint::

   Neither LED Blinky nor LED Fade can be built and executed on this
   board, because this system has only one digital RGB LED.
   A simple GPIO or PWM control is not possible!

You should see the following message on the console:

   .. admonition:: Console Output
      :class: note dropdown toggle-shown

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            \*\*\* Booting Zephyr OS build |zephyr_version_em|\ *…*\*\*\*
            [00:00:00.003,000] <inf> main: Found LED strip device ws2812
            [00:00:00.003,000] <inf> main: Displaying pattern on strip
